[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 601.75, "timestamp": "00:10:01", "text": "放弃很多我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 605.11, "timestamp": "00:10:05", "text": "珍视的东西，转而使用更好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 609.11, "timestamp": "00:10:09", "text": "软件。虽然它很好，但也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 612.23, "timestamp": "00:10:12", "text": "存在一些局限性，但我能够"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 614.63, "timestamp": "00:10:14", "text": "积极寻求帮助，最终让它正常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 617.35, "timestamp": "00:10:17", "text": "运行。 很高兴"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 620.55, "timestamp": "00:10:20", "text": "事情能得到解决，值得庆幸的是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 623.11, "timestamp": "00:10:23", "text": "现在奎因警官终于可以安心了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 625.91, "timestamp": "00:10:25", "text": "。 那真不错。 那挺好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 628.87, "timestamp": "00:10:28", "text": "非常好。   是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 632.63, "timestamp": "00:10:32", "text": "的，嗯，是的，我终于打扫了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 635.11, "timestamp": "00:10:35", "text": "我的房间，我已经三个月没打扫了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 636.55, "timestamp": "00:10:36", "text": "。 我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 638.069, "timestamp": "00:10:38", "text": "该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 639.829, "timestamp": "00:10:39", "text": "不是三个月，大概四个月吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 643.11, "timestamp": "00:10:43", "text": "不，不，等等。 我像平常一样进行了中途清洁，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 645.67, "timestamp": "00:10:45", "text": "但没有进行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 649.03, "timestamp": "00:10:49", "text": "深度清洁。 是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 651.75, "timestamp": "00:10:51", "text": "上周日做了那件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 655.11, "timestamp": "00:10:55", "text": "是上周日吗？ 是的。 呃，不是星期天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 658.15, "timestamp": "00:10:58", "text": "其实是星期三。 星期三，星期四。   是的"}]